# Local-only neighbours of the project: the user's own voice recordings
# (`voice-agent/*.wav`), a side experiment that keeps a plaintext key
# (`mini-agent/.deepseek-key`), design mockups and scratch test scratch.
# None of it belongs to Wanna, and a stray `git add -A` would publish all of
# it — so it is blocked here rather than left to be noticed at commit time.
voice-agent/
mini-agent/
design-preview/
.tmp-open-test/

# 屏幕 OCR 的调试产物：截图和它的全文识别结果。**里面是用户屏幕上的真实内容**
# （窗口标题、正文片段），推到 GitHub 就等于把这些内容公开出去 —— 和这个文件里
# 挡住 voice-agent / mini-agent 是同一个理由，只是内容更贴脸。
# 工具在 tools/截图与OCR/，产物不入库。

# 截图与OCR 的编译产物 —— README 自己写的「build.sh 生成，不入库」。
tools/截图与OCR/ocr
截图-左侧-*.png
截图-左侧-*.txt
屏幕文字-*.txt

# The running app appends to its own run log, so the newest one is never stable.
开发经验/运行日志/wanna-冷重开验证-20260924-123505.log

# Python bytecode. Machine-generated, pinned to one interpreter — the file that
# prompted this entry is `bench_route.cpython-314.pyc`, useless to any other Python —
# and it stamps in the absolute path its source was compiled at. No amount of editing
# the source corrects that, because the path comes from `__file__`, not from a literal.
# It is how the file was caught: this repository moved on 2026-09-26 and the bytecode
# still read the checkout’s previous location under `~/Desktop/`, a location that had stopped existing, while
# its source was perfectly clean. The 分流测速 benchmarks keep their sources and their
# result files on purpose; the compiled form is not one of them.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# 运行时产物：app 自己读写的四个目录。2026-09-26 从桌面搬进 checkout 并改名
# `Wanna*`，路径统一由 `WorkspaceDirectory` 给出 —— 它们跟着 checkout 走，但
# 它们是**运行数据**，不是源码：Wanna录音 一个目录就是 240MB+、上千个 wav。
# 不入库，否则第一次 `git add -A` 就会把用户的所有录音推上 GitHub。
Wanna录音/
Wanna图形/
Wanna复盘/
WannaAgents/

# 参考资料：建这个项目时用过的调研素材（动画、几何示例、需求文档、复盘…）。
# 2026-09-26 从桌面搬进来，方便和代码放在一起查阅。**放在 checkout 里但不入库**
# —— 体积大，而且里面混着第三方内容（竞品截图之类），不该跟着仓库发出去。
参考资料/
